						"description": "Stream AI response in real-time using Server-Sent Events (SSE)\n\n**Note:** Use EventSource in browser or SSE client to properly handle streaming.\n\nResponse format:\n```\nevent: content\ndata: {\"content\":\"Hello\"}\n\nevent: content\ndata: {\"content\":\" world\"}\n\nevent: done\ndata: {\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":10,\"completion_tokens\":50}}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
